cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DiodeWatch in academic work, cite it using this metadata."
title: "DiodeWatch: passive AI threat detection for one-way (data-diode) network links"
abstract: >
  A passive detection pipeline for unidirectional IP traffic. Flow records are
  built once and measured once, then read by rule, window and machine-learning
  channels whose alerts are deduplicated by identity, chained tamper-evidently,
  and exported as STIX 2.1 or as analyst reports. The stack never needs a return
  path, never decrypts, and reports an observation only where the host actually
  made one.
type: software
